@startuml resolution-cascade-level3-aws
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
title Resolution cascade -- Level 3: QuickFaaS deployment (AWS)

participant "Resolver\n(AwsInternalFunctionResolver)" as R
participant "InternalFunctionDeployer" as D
participant "AwsLambdaDeployer" as ALD
participant "QuickFaaS JAR\n(subprocess)" as QF
participant "FunctionRegistryStore" as REG

note over R
  reached only after a Level 2 miss with a
  deploymentDescriptorPath supplied
  (see resolution-cascade-level2-aws.puml)
end note

R -> D : deployOrUpdate(functionName, deploymentDescriptorPath)
D -> ALD : deployOrUpdate(functionName, descriptorPath)
note right of ALD
  full breakdown (IAM role, S3 bucket region,
  subprocess retries, GetFunction polling,
  Step Functions permission grant) is in
  aws-deploy-sequence.puml
end note
ALD -> ALD : resolve/create Lambda execution IAM role
ALD -> ALD : patch role ARN into descriptor copy
ALD -> ALD : determine effective region from S3 bucket
ALD -> QF : invoke(descriptor)\n[<=3 attempts, 20s backoff]
QF --> ALD : subprocess completed
ALD -> ALD : poll GetFunction until State = Active\n(<=180s, 5s interval)
ALD -> ALD : grant Step Functions invoke permission
ALD --> D : FunctionInvocationMetadata\n(serviceName, url = arn:aws:lambda:...)

D --> R : FunctionInvocationMetadata
R -> REG : put(functionName, metadata)
R --> R : return metadata.url
@enduml
